{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは\n【お知らせ】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆発売中の月刊エンタメさんに\n純奈、蘭世、みり愛、琴子、絢音と\n4ページ分載っています\nインタビュー盛り沢山です！\nあと、私が描いた西野さんの似顔絵も\n掲載されているので、\nそこも是非注目してみてね（＾_＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"----------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"使用アプリ/Camera360、B612\nAfterlight\n撮影場所/部屋、洗面所、どっか外\nお洋服/UNIQLOのタートルニット\nジェラートピケのパーカー\nどこかのボーダーワンピ\ndazzlinのジージャン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/04/03/6105875/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/04/03/6105875/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/04/03/6105875/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/04/03/6105875/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/04/03/6105875/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/04/03/6105875/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/04/03/6105875/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/04/03/6105875/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/04/03/6105875/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/04/03/6105875/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/04/03/6105875/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/04/03/6105875/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/04/03/6105875/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/04/03/6105875/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/04/03/6105875/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/04/03/6105875/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/04/03/6105875/0016.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/04/03/6105875/0017.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/04/03/6105875/0018.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/04/03/6105875/0019.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/04/03/6105875/0020.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のvol.2（/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/smph/2015/02/022807.php）\nで載せた写真の中で、\nアイライン引いてないから雰囲気が\nゆるっとナチュラルに\n見えるパターンのがあるんだけど、\nそれがコメントで好評だったから\n今回からメイクも\nとことん研究してみました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チークをふわっとハート型にしたり\nそばかす描いたり\n髪にお花の飾り付けたり\n目の下に赤い練りチーク入れたり\n髪をボブ風にしたり\n前髪を流しておでこ出したり！\n細かい作業は好きなので楽しいです～\nちなみに流行りの\n目の下の涙袋がプクっていうやつ、\n私の目元には存在しないので\nいいなぁと思う日々です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の自撮り写真集でこれが好き！\nなどあったらブログコメントで\nよかったら教えてください∧( 'Θ' )∧"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、この前のブログで\nオススメの映画を教えてくださった方\nありがとうございましたm(__)m\n『神様のカルテ2』\n『謝罪の王様』\nあと映画ではないですが長編ドラマで\n『あんみつ姫』を観ました\nちなみに朝早く起きて観たり\n移動時間に観たり\n寝る前に観たりと\nタイミングはまちまちです～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、5/3の個握の5部が\n完売いたしました！！\nすごく嬉しいです...♡\n本当にありがとうございますm(__)m\nこれからも皆さんに\n楽しいと思ってもらえる握手会を\nしていきたいと思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の名古屋アルバム握手会と\n明後日の京都個握も楽しみだな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「お」"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/04/03/6105875/0021.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「や」"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/04/03/6105875/0022.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「す」"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/04/03/6105875/0023.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「み」"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/04/03/6105875/0024.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「（ばいばい～）」"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/04/03/6105875/0025.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4月を迎えましたね～\nいよいよ新学期\nついに高校3年生になります\n乃木坂46加入と同じタイミングで\n高校入学したからか\n何だか慌ただしかったし\nあっという間だったなぁ\n今年は自分を変える年、\n変化のある年にしたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずはアンダーライブ。\n毎度お馴染みのことですが、\nいろんな意味で\n前代未聞の壁が立ちはだかっている...\n毎日ぶつかり中です\nこえてみせるぞーうおー！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなち"}],"source":"archive"}